69326cb9b36949fc72dc4b7f,일흥콩나물국밥,"Folks… im writing this review because I NEED it to be recorded somewhere just how much I love this place. I’ve been coming here regularly for years… The 국밥 is not overloaded with 콩나물, and the soup is deep, but light. I feel like it heals my soul every time I have it. The owner has clearly mastered his craft. If he ever decides to retire and close shop, I will actually cry.",,,25.12.5.금,1,20885973,hea****,1,https://pup-review-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNTEyMDVfMTcw/MDAxNzY0OTEyMzExNTU1.0X_Vo7Ha4vJGTHrN1dR02wUh8lsMQGpLFrH17X6wBt8g.UzqvfHbJswLME8IrM_ji7BDyDB6x8Y0dV27Gz3Zr370g.JPEG/5B560FFB-34A3-4758-837A-916443CB7F1B.jpeg | https://pup-review-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNTEyMDVfMTI3/MDAxNzY0OTEyMzExOTIy.lxETOoWevL650vsw8b-6mEAUQCwrYkkp5A2AxISE8oUg.IeveAMImEAuFBZpbrI9wagmAJ6f2muld1WePN5X1Gl8g.JPEG/06E21EC6-4F35-47A9-BEA0-26DF1D681FF4.jpeg?type=w1500_60_sharpen,https://pup-review-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNTEyMDVfMTcw/MDAxNzY0OTEyMzExNTU1.0X_Vo7Ha4vJGTHrN1dR02wUh8lsMQGpLFrH17X6wBt8g.UzqvfHbJswLME8IrM_ji7BDyDB6x8Y0dV27Gz3Zr370g.JPEG/5B560FFB-34A3-4758-837A-916443CB7F1B.jpeg | https://pup-review-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNTEyMDVfMTI3/MDAxNzY0OTEyMzExOTIy.lxETOoWevL650vsw8b-6mEAUQCwrYkkp5A2AxISE8oUg.IeveAMImEAuFBZpbrI9wagmAJ6f2muld1WePN5X1Gl8g.JPEG/06E21EC6-4F35-47A9-BEA0-26DF1D681FF4.jpeg?type=w1500_60_sharpen,,,2,"음식이 맛있어요, 가성비가 좋아요, 재료가 신선해요, 건강한 맛이에요, 혼밥하기 좋아요","(예약 없이 이용), 대기 시간(바로 입장), (일상), (혼자)",,,콩나물국밥,2026-05-28T15:50:49.736549+00:00,True
693ec9b9c67c54500d725012,일흥콩나물국밥,"맛있게 잘 먹었습니다. 콩나물 국밥은 시원하게 먹기 좋게 담백한 스타일이로 맛있어요.

근처 목욕탕에서 시원하게 목욕하고 점심에 모주도 한 잔 하면서 먹으니까 더 맛있있었어요. 특히 저 갈색빛 젓갈이 킥입니다. 고추를 반찬으로 주시는 것도 좋은 거 같아요. 보시다시피 싹싹 긁어 먹었습니다.

아쉬운 건 깍두기가 좀 제 입맛에는 안 맞았습니다. 그래도 정말 맛있게 먹었고 오래오래 장사하셨으면 즇겠어요~~",,,25.12.14.일,1,20885973,팥죽중독,1,https://pup-review-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNTEyMTRfNTkg/MDAxNzY1NzIyNTUxNjMx.y_5zHCZTLTxIjKN7YtiMm99vtRyf55AyNF_WdwctswYg.64JboMkunvPjXmZPV4rDCUUyAHE3JDH5zXNSmCTCVHwg.JPEG/B9A1FCF6-7870-4E72-9586-E12D99B49D29.jpeg | https://pup-review-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNTEyMTRfMTc0/MDAxNzY1NzIyNTUxOTc3.452lRdeeqvSwEegJoKYarNWC6vckxXejEm11m4Ogb5kg.weerrSlTolCRenDr86kvaBD5E1H-PA48a1cH_sq28-cg.JPEG/72AB5150-3E83-4B7A-AD74-AFBC6A73CDF1.jpeg?type=w1500_60_sharpen,https://pup-review-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNTEyMTRfNTkg/MDAxNzY1NzIyNTUxNjMx.y_5zHCZTLTxIjKN7YtiMm99vtRyf55AyNF_WdwctswYg.64JboMkunvPjXmZPV4rDCUUyAHE3JDH5zXNSmCTCVHwg.JPEG/B9A1FCF6-7870-4E72-9586-E12D99B49D29.jpeg | https://pup-review-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNTEyMTRfMTc0/MDAxNzY1NzIyNTUxOTc3.452lRdeeqvSwEegJoKYarNWC6vckxXejEm11m4Ogb5kg.weerrSlTolCRenDr86kvaBD5E1H-PA48a1cH_sq28-cg.JPEG/72AB5150-3E83-4B7A-AD74-AFBC6A73CDF1.jpeg?type=w1500_60_sharpen,,,2,"음식이 맛있어요, 특별한 메뉴가 있어요, 가성비가 좋아요, 혼밥하기 좋아요, 매장이 청결해요","(예약 없이 이용), 대기 시간(바로 입장), (일상), (혼자)",,,콩나물국밥,2026-05-28T15:50:49.736558+00:00,True
